Existential quantifiers moved into the past and future diamonds they commute
with (Dense_Push.thy).  Each formula is run through the verified monitor; the
expected output was recorded from the verified monitor before the rewrite, and
matches MonPoly's wherever MonPoly monitors the formula.  The last formulas are
shapes the rewrite leaves alone: a Since with a proper left operand, a
conjunction with a trigger on the right, and LET.

  $ while IFS= read -r phi; do
  >   [ -z "$phi" ] && continue
  >   printf '%s\n' "$phi" > f.mfotl
  >   echo "=== $phi"
  >   monpoly -verified -sig cov.sig -formula f.mfotl -log cov.log 2>&1
  > done < formulas.txt
